    - target: {fileID: 134540935242368777, guid: 8ceb726ec6d92264eaf5e690f9c19af8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Welcome to Excroaalibur\u2019s first demo !\n\r\nHere, your goal is
        to get the Sword on the altar and to survive as much waves of enemies as
        possible by killing them by throwing the Sword at them. But be careful not
        loosing it, because the enemies will try to get it back to the altar, making
        you loose.\n\r\nTo start your turn, push the altar to get the Sword !"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
